  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localizing SDGs: for Local by Local in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to strengthen social cohesion and civil society capacity in Cox&#x2019;s Bazar district (Bangladesh) by addressing the socioeconomic needs of vulnerable households in selected host communities affected by the refugee influx, strengthening the technical capacity of local organizations to implement socioeconomic activities, improving service delivery and sustaining development gains. In addition to this, the project aims to strengthen civil society capacity inside the camps by strengthening camp-based representation and community-based protection.</narrative>
  </description>
